data: {"messages":[{"content":"请把仓库事件的截图、前后 20 秒片段、哈希和打码副本整理成证据包。","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":null,"id":"22168275-7548-47d3-b77f-f0605db52d74"},{"content":"<skill_system source=\"skill_router\">\nYou have access to skills that provide optimized workflows for specific tasks. Each skill contains best practices, frameworks, and references to additional resources.\n\n**Skill Availability Rules:**\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt are available across turns.\n- Custom/domain skills are available only when listed in a current-turn routed <available_skills> section.\n- Ignore custom/domain skills mentioned in previous turns if they are not listed in the current turn.\n- Do not call tools associated with unavailable skills.\n- If a later current-turn routed_skill_prompt is injected by SkillRouter, its <available_skills> list recommends the custom/domain skills for this turn; public skills from the base prompt remain available as supporting workflows.\n- When SkillRouter ranking is disabled and scene filtering injects all skills for a scene, treat <available_skills> as an allowed candidate set. Select the specific skill or skills that match the current user request before loading skill files or executing workflows.\n\n**Override Scope:**\n- This routed <skill_system> lists recommended custom/domain skills for the current turn.\n- It does NOT replace the base system prompt.\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt remain available for supporting operations.\n- When uploaded structured files (Excel, CSV, JSON, Parquet, or similar tabular evidence) are central to the user's request, use the public data-analysis skill first to inspect and extract facts before domain synthesis.\n- Continue following language_policy, clarification_system, working_directory, response_style, and critical_reminders from the base system prompt.\n\n**Progressive Loading Pattern:**\n1. When a user query matches an available skill's use case, first choose the concrete skill.\n2. Call `invoke_skill` in `prepare` mode for that selected skill to create and validate the SkillInputEnvelope and legacy invocation package.\n3. Read the returned skill file path and understand the skill's workflow and instructions.\n4. The skill file contains references to external resources under the same folder.\n5. Load referenced resources only when needed during execution.\n6. Follow the skill's instructions precisely.\n7. After legacy execution, call `invoke_skill` in `wrap_output` mode to normalize the result into SkillResult when a machine-readable Skill output is needed.\n\n**Mandatory Skill Execution Discipline:**\n- Calling `invoke_skill` in `prepare` mode is NOT sufficient. It only prepares the selected Skill invocation. After `prepare`, you MUST actually execute the selected Skill workflow.\n- After `invoke_skill(mode=\"prepare\")` returns `legacy_invocation.container_skill_file`, you MUST read that Skill file and treat it as the authoritative execution guide.\n- If the Skill provides scripts, commands, templates, references, or executable workflows, you MUST use those Skill-provided assets first.\n- Do NOT replace a matched Skill workflow with ad hoc Python, pandas, SQL, shell, or manual analysis code before attempting the Skill workflow.\n- For `data-analysis`, if `/mnt/skills/public/data-analysis/scripts/analyze.py` is available and the task is structured data analysis, you MUST call that script first for data inspection, SQL query, aggregation, statistics, or chart preparation. Do not write standalone pandas code for the same operation before trying this script.\n- Custom code is allowed only after one of these conditions is true:\n  1. the selected Skill file does not provide a suitable executable workflow;\n  2. the Skill-provided script or workflow has been attempted and failed;\n  3. the user explicitly requests custom code;\n  4. the required operation is clearly outside the Skill's documented capability.\n- When you fall back to custom code, briefly state that the Skill workflow was insufficient or failed, and continue from the Skill result or error.\n\n**Skill Loading Priority Rules:**\n- If a request clearly matches an available skill and also includes uploaded files, load the skill file before reading uploaded data files.\n- Do NOT read a full uploaded structured data file before loading the matched skill.\n- For uploaded structured data files, use small previews only when needed.\n- Prefer the matched skill's scripts, workflows, or tools for actual analysis.\n- Do not start by generating ad hoc JS, Python, SQL, or shell scripts when a matched skill exists.\n- Only improvise custom code after loading the matched skill and confirming the skill does not already provide a suitable workflow.\n\n**Skills are located at:** /mnt/skills\n\n<available_skills>\n    <skill>\n      <name>association-path-analysis</name>\n      <description>分析两个电话号码之间是否存在直接通话路径、间接多跳路径、共享设备路径、共同对端路径或复合桥接链路。适用于用户询问两个号码如何关联、是否存在中间节点或关系链路的场景；不用于数据概览、TopN 风险发现、单号码画像、群体团伙识别或跨省同实体联动判断。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/association-path-analysis/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>condition-based-screening</name>\n      <description>根据用户已经明确给出的筛选条件，在电话网络号码集合中执行规则过滤，找出“满足这些条件”的对象，并输出筛选链路、命中号码、命中原因和证据附件。核心任务是条件命中，不是风险排行榜；适用于用户明确提出“筛选/过滤/满足条件/按省份/按标签/按阈值/同时满足”等规则约束的场景，例如筛选夜间通话占比超过阈值、联系人广度高于阈值、共享设备数量达到阈值的号码。不用于系统自动发现最可疑号码、不生成全量 TopN 风险榜、不做综合风险排名、不承担单号码证据包、原始数据建图或地域对比。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/condition-based-screening/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>dataset-onboarding-graph-preprocess</name>\n      <description>将新上传的电话网络原始 CSV、Excel、JSON 或 Parquet 数据进行字段识别、清洗、质量检查和建图预处理，生成 user_nodes.csv、call_edges.csv、edges_phone_imei.parquet 等标准图结构文件。适用于原始数据接入、无法建图诊断和字段映射；已是标准图结构的数据应先走数据质量诊断或具体分析 skill。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/dataset-onboarding-graph-preprocess/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>dataset-overview-analysis</name>\n      <description>对已经形成标准图结构的电话网络数据集做总体概览，统计号码规模、通话边规模、设备边规模、风险标签分布、省份分布、时间覆盖和可分析能力范围。适用于回答“数据里有什么、规模多大、能做什么”；不用于建图、TopN 排名、单号码下钻或团伙簇识别。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/dataset-overview-analysis/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>dataset-quality-and-linkability-diagnostic</name>\n      <description>诊断电话网络数据集是否具备标准图结构、数据质量是否满足后续分析条件、各下游 skill 是否可用，并检查多省份数据的 ID 命名空间与跨省可联动性前提。适用于数据体检、能力矩阵、unified 是否支持跨省实体联动等问题；诊断结论不得被夸大为业务事实。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/dataset-quality-and-linkability-diagnostic/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>gang-cluster-analysis</name>\n      <description>围绕一组电话号码或候选对象识别疑似团伙簇，综合共享设备、共同对端、内部关系、邻居重叠和多跳关联输出候选簇、核心节点、桥接点和证据链。适用于团伙/簇/核心成员/桥接点问题；不用于单号码画像、TopN 排名、地域对比或确认性案件定性。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/gang-cluster-analysis/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>graph-operator</name>\n      <description>提供电话网络图数据的基础图分析算子，包括节点查询、邻居展开、共享设备、共同对端、共同设备、路径追踪、子图抽取和基础图统计。该 skill 更适合作为上层业务 skill 的底层积木；普通用户问业务结论时应优先路由到对应业务分析 skill。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/graph-operator/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>group-risk-analysis</name>\n      <description>对一组电话号码开展群体级风险分析，统计群体规模、行为模式、夜间异常、联系人广度、共享设备、共同对端、核心成员和证据完整度。适用于群体画像和群体风险归纳；若用户强调团伙簇、核心节点和桥接点，应优先使用 gang-cluster-analysis。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/group-risk-analysis/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>overlap-analysis</name>\n      <description>分析两个电话号码之间的关系重叠情况，包括共同对端、共享设备、直接通话、重叠比例和关键证据点。适用于用户询问两个号码有没有共同联系人、共同设备或联系圈重叠；不负责多跳路径解释、单号画像、群体分析或地域对比。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/overlap-analysis/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>risk-evidence-pack</name>\n      <description>为单个电话号码生成结构化风险证据包，汇总号码画像、风险结论、通话证据、共享设备证据、共同对端证据、证据评分和后续下钻建议。适用于“为什么高风险”“整理证据包”“生成可交付材料”等问题；不用于全局 TopN 发现或群体团伙识别。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/risk-evidence-pack/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>shared-device-analysis</name>\n      <description>分析电话号码与设备之间的共享关系，支持单号码共享设备扩散、两个号码是否共用设备、单设备挂载号码和设备池线索分析。适用于共享设备/同设备池问题；输出仅作为风险线索，不等同于最终团伙认定或可靠跨省同实体联动判断。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/shared-device-analysis/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>sichuan-shaanxi-comparison</name>\n      <description>比较四川与陕西电话网络数据在对象规模、风险标签、行为模式、共享设备规模、群体结构、时间覆盖和代表性对象上的地域差异。该 skill 只做地域对比和汇报材料，不做跨省同实体联动、跨省共享设备识别或跨省共同对端识别。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/sichuan-shaanxi-comparison/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>single-number-analysis</name>\n      <description>对单个电话号码进行完整综合画像和下钻分析，输出基础属性、通话行为、联系人广度、共享设备、关系圈规模、Top 可疑节点、桥接/枢纽角色、风险解释和 Markdown 报告。适用于完整分析一个号码；若用户要求正式证据包，应使用 risk-evidence-pack。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/single-number-analysis/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>subgraph-extraction-analysis</name>\n      <description>围绕单个中心电话号码抽取 1 跳或 2 跳局部关系子图，输出局部节点、边、邻居结构、局部核心节点和桥接点。仅适用于“抽局部图、看邻居结构、看局部关系圈”的问题；完整单号码综合分析应使用 single-number-analysis。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/subgraph-extraction-analysis/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>time-series-anomaly-analysis</name>\n      <description>围绕单个号码或号码集合的时间变化分析活跃趋势、近期窗口与基线窗口差异、夜间行为变化、异常日期、小时分布和阶段性风险上升。适用于时间趋势和异常突变问题；需要通话边中存在可用时间字段。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/time-series-anomaly-analysis/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>topn-high-risk-discovery</name>\n      <description>在用户没有指定硬性筛选条件时，基于预设综合风险评分模型对电话网络全量号码进行自动打分、排序和候选发现，输出 TopN 高风险排行榜、风险分、排名驱动因素和证据摘要。核心任务是自动发现“最值得优先核查”的对象，不是按用户规则过滤；适用于“找 Top10 高风险号码/生成风险排行榜/哪些号码最可疑/自动发现重点对象/综合评分排序”等开放式发现问题。不用于按省份、标签、夜间阈值、联系人阈值、共享设备阈值等明确条件筛选号码，不解释单个号码，不生成单号码证据包，不做原始数据建图或地域对比。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/topn-high-risk-discovery/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n</available_skills>\n\n</skill_system>","additional_kwargs":{"message_type":"routed_skill_prompt","internal":true},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":"routing_skill_guidance","id":"a30b8aab-bde7-4265-a318-eb7e82eb856d"}],"viewed_images":{},"thread_data":{"workspace_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/15cecaf4-732f-4d0b-9004-3f1404db7747/user-data/workspace","uploads_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/15cecaf4-732f-4d0b-9004-3f1404db7747/user-data/uploads","outputs_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/15cecaf4-732f-4d0b-9004-3f1404db7747/user-data/outputs"},"raw_messages":[],"artifacts":[],"intent_context":{"intent":"task","original_query":"请把仓库事件的截图、前后 20 秒片段、哈希和打码副本整理成证据包。","normalized_query":"请把仓库事件的截图、前后 20 秒片段、哈希和打码副本整理成证据包。","routing_query":"场景：电话网络。场景ID：phone_network。场景说明：电话通信网络、移动通信网络、基站、小区、话单、CDR、通话记录、呼叫链路、信令、IMS、VoLTE、短信、漫游、掉话、接通率、投诉、通信质量、号码画像、共享设备、共同对端、关联路径、团伙聚类、风险证据包和高风险号码分析场景。需要识别参数：分析对象、时间范围、网络指标、分析目标。用户原始问题：我将把仓库事件的截图、前后20秒片段、哈希和打码副本整理成证据包","scene":"phone_network","scene_name":"电话网络","params":{"分析对象":"","时间范围":"","网络指标":"","分析目标":""},"scene_mode":"single","scenes":["phone_network"],"task_spans":[{"task_span_id":"span_b3515f","text":"请把仓库事件的截图、前后 20 秒片段、哈希和打码副本整理成证据包。"}],"planning_steps":[{"task_span_id":"span_9501ab","text":"读取仓库事件相关的截图、前后20秒视频片段、哈希值文件及打码副本，解析视频时间轴与帧结构，执行文件完整性校验与哈希一致性比对，输出结构化媒体索引表及合格文件集。"},{"task_span_id":"span_cefc15","text":"结合phone_network场景需求，提取媒体文件中的事件时间戳，检索并对齐对应的通信链路或基站信令时序数据，建立多模态证据与网络参数的时间映射关系，输出场景关联标注清单。"},{"task_span_id":"span_d253a7","text":"依据电子取证规范对校验通过的媒体文件、网络映射数据进行分类归档，生成打码副本的数字指纹与防篡改签名，配置压缩包访问权限，输出符合司法或审计标准的初步证据包。"},{"task_span_id":"span_ede8f5","text":"汇总文件清单、哈希校验报告、场景分析依据与操作溯源记录，打包生成最终交付物，提供可回溯的证据链说明文档供后续研判调用。"}],"scene_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_4fe76d","scene":"phone_network","scene_name":"电话网络","text":"我将把仓库事件的截图、前后20秒片段、哈希和打码副本整理成证据包。","params":{}}],"sub_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_4fe76d","scene":"phone_network","scene_name":"电话网络","text":"我将把仓库事件的截图、前后20秒片段、哈希和打码副本整理成证据包。","params":{}}],"task_hints":["提取必填参数：分析对象。需要分析的电话网络数据、话单 CDR、基站、小区、用户号码、呼叫链路、短信记录、信令日志或通信事件","提取可选参数：时间范围。电话网络统计或故障分析的起止时间、日期、时段或相对时间","提取可选参数：网络指标。电话网络指标，如接通率、掉话率、呼叫失败、通话时长、短信量、漫游、信令异常、IMS、VoLTE、基站负荷、小区拥塞等","提取可选参数：分析目标。统计、对比、定位故障、识别异常、投诉研判、质量评估、趋势分析或生成报告"],"mentioned_skill_ids":[],"confidence":0.9,"reason":"llm_scene_slot_rewrite","_source_message_key":"id:22168275-7548-47d3-b77f-f0605db52d74"},"routing_context":{"route_mode":"scene_filter","trigger":true,"primary_goal":"请把仓库事件的截图、前后 20 秒片段、哈希和打码副本整理成证据包。","scene_tasks":[{"scene_task_id":"task_001","segment_id":"seg_001","segment_text":"请把仓库事件的截图、前后 20 秒片段、哈希和打码副本整理成证据包。","scene":"phone_network","input_refs":[],"task_types":[],"selected_skills":[{"id":"association-path-analysis","role":"primary","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"condition-based-screening","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"dataset-onboarding-graph-preprocess","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"dataset-overview-analysis","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"dataset-quality-and-linkability-diagnostic","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"gang-cluster-analysis","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"graph-operator","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"group-risk-analysis","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"overlap-analysis","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"risk-evidence-pack","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"shared-device-analysis","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"sichuan-shaanxi-comparison","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"single-number-analysis","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"subgraph-extraction-analysis","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"time-series-anomaly-analysis","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"topn-high-risk-discovery","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null}],"expected_outputs":[],"depends_on":[]}],"global_selected_skills":["association-path-analysis","condition-based-screening","dataset-onboarding-graph-preprocess","dataset-overview-analysis","dataset-quality-and-linkability-diagnostic","gang-cluster-analysis","graph-operator","group-risk-analysis","overlap-analysis","risk-evidence-pack","shared-device-analysis","sichuan-shaanxi-comparison","single-number-analysis","subgraph-extraction-analysis","time-series-anomaly-analysis","topn-high-risk-discovery"],"default_public_skill_ids":[],"global_allowed_tools":[],"confidence":1.0,"route_reason":"SkillRouter disabled; injected all custom skills for detected intent scene as LeadAgent candidate skills","allowed_skills":["association-path-analysis","condition-based-screening","dataset-onboarding-graph-preprocess","dataset-overview-analysis","dataset-quality-and-linkability-diagnostic","gang-cluster-analysis","graph-operator","group-risk-analysis","overlap-analysis","risk-evidence-pack","shared-device-analysis","sichuan-shaanxi-comparison","single-number-analysis","subgraph-extraction-analysis","time-series-anomaly-analysis","topn-high-risk-discovery"],"selection_owner":"lead_agent","_source_message_key":"id:22168275-7548-47d3-b77f-f0605db52d74"},"dialogue_context":{"act":"new_task","confidence":0.7,"reason":"no_pending_action_match","parsed_answer":null,"pending_action_id":null,"resume_intent_context":null,"resume_routing_context":null,"metadata":{}},"final_scope_skill_ids":["association-path-analysis","condition-based-screening","dataset-onboarding-graph-preprocess","dataset-overview-analysis","dataset-quality-and-linkability-diagnostic","gang-cluster-analysis","graph-operator","group-risk-analysis","overlap-analysis","risk-evidence-pack","shared-device-analysis","sichuan-shaanxi-comparison","single-number-analysis","subgraph-extraction-analysis","time-series-anomaly-analysis","topn-high-risk-discovery"],"allowed_tool_names":[]}

event: values
data: {"messages":[{"content":"请把仓库事件的截图、前后 20 秒片段、哈希和打码副本整理成证据包。","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":null,"id":"22168275-7548-47d3-b77f-f0605db52d74"},{"content":"<skill_system source=\"skill_router\">\nYou have access to skills that provide optimized workflows for specific tasks. Each skill contains best practices, frameworks, and references to additional resources.\n\n**Skill Availability Rules:**\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt are available across turns.\n- Custom/domain skills are available only when listed in a current-turn routed <available_skills> section.\n- Ignore custom/domain skills mentioned in previous turns if they are not listed in the current turn.\n- Do not call tools associated with unavailable skills.\n- If a later current-turn routed_skill_prompt is injected by SkillRouter, its <available_skills> list recommends the custom/domain skills for this turn; public skills from the base prompt remain available as supporting workflows.\n- When SkillRouter ranking is disabled and scene filtering injects all skills for a scene, treat <available_skills> as an allowed candidate set. Select the specific skill or skills that match the current user request before loading skill files or executing workflows.\n\n**Override Scope:**\n- This routed <skill_system> lists recommended custom/domain skills for the current turn.\n- It does NOT replace the base system prompt.\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt remain available for supporting operations.\n- When uploaded structured files (Excel, CSV, JSON, Parquet, or similar tabular evidence) are central to the user's request, use the public data-analysis skill first to inspect and extract facts before domain synthesis.\n- Continue following language_policy, clarification_system, working_directory, response_style, and critical_reminders from the base system prompt.\n\n**Progressive Loading Pattern:**\n1. When a user query matches an available skill's use case, first choose the concrete skill.\n2. Call `invoke_skill` in `prepare` mode for that selected skill to create and validate the SkillInputEnvelope and legacy invocation package.\n3. Read the returned skill file path and understand the skill's workflow and instructions.\n4. The skill file contains references to external resources under the same folder.\n5. Load referenced resources only when needed during execution.\n6. Follow the skill's instructions precisely.\n7. After legacy execution, call `invoke_skill` in `wrap_output` mode to normalize the result into SkillResult when a machine-readable Skill output is needed.\n\n**Mandatory Skill Execution Discipline:**\n- Calling `invoke_skill` in `prepare` mode is NOT sufficient. It only prepares the selected Skill invocation. After `prepare`, you MUST actually execute the selected Skill workflow.\n- After `invoke_skill(mode=\"prepare\")` returns `legacy_invocation.container_skill_file`, you MUST read that Skill file and treat it as the authoritative execution guide.\n- If the Skill provides scripts, commands, templates, references, or executable workflows, you MUST use those Skill-provided assets first.\n- Do NOT replace a matched Skill workflow with ad hoc Python, pandas, SQL, shell, or manual analysis code before attempting the Skill workflow.\n- For `data-analysis`, if `/mnt/skills/public/data-analysis/scripts/analyze.py` is available and the task is structured data analysis, you MUST call that script first for data inspection, SQL query, aggregation, statistics, or chart preparation. Do not write standalone pandas code for the same operation before trying this script.\n- Custom code is allowed only after one of these conditions is true:\n  1. the selected Skill file does not provide a suitable executable workflow;\n  2. the Skill-provided script or workflow has been attempted and failed;\n  3. the user explicitly requests custom code;\n  4. the required operation is clearly outside the Skill's documented capability.\n- When you fall back to custom code, briefly state that the Skill workflow was insufficient or failed, and continue from the Skill result or error.\n\n**Skill Loading Priority Rules:**\n- If a request clearly matches an available skill and also includes uploaded files, load the skill file before reading uploaded data files.\n- Do NOT read a full uploaded structured data file before loading the matched skill.\n- For uploaded structured data files, use small previews only when needed.\n- Prefer the matched skill's scripts, workflows, or tools for actual analysis.\n- Do not start by generating ad hoc JS, Python, SQL, or shell scripts when a matched skill exists.\n- Only improvise custom code after loading the matched skill and confirming the skill does not already provide a suitable workflow.\n\n**Skills are located at:** /mnt/skills\n\n<available_skills>\n    <skill>\n      <name>association-path-analysis</name>\n      <description>分析两个电话号码之间是否存在直接通话路径、间接多跳路径、共享设备路径、共同对端路径或复合桥接链路。适用于用户询问两个号码如何关联、是否存在中间节点或关系链路的场景；不用于数据概览、TopN 风险发现、单号码画像、群体团伙识别或跨省同实体联动判断。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/association-path-analysis/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>condition-based-screening</name>\n      <description>根据用户已经明确给出的筛选条件，在电话网络号码集合中执行规则过滤，找出“满足这些条件”的对象，并输出筛选链路、命中号码、命中原因和证据附件。核心任务是条件命中，不是风险排行榜；适用于用户明确提出“筛选/过滤/满足条件/按省份/按标签/按阈值/同时满足”等规则约束的场景，例如筛选夜间通话占比超过阈值、联系人广度高于阈值、共享设备数量达到阈值的号码。不用于系统自动发现最可疑号码、不生成全量 TopN 风险榜、不做综合风险排名、不承担单号码证据包、原始数据建图或地域对比。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/condition-based-screening/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>dataset-onboarding-graph-preprocess</name>\n      <description>将新上传的电话网络原始 CSV、Excel、JSON 或 Parquet 数据进行字段识别、清洗、质量检查和建图预处理，生成 user_nodes.csv、call_edges.csv、edges_phone_imei.parquet 等标准图结构文件。适用于原始数据接入、无法建图诊断和字段映射；已是标准图结构的数据应先走数据质量诊断或具体分析 skill。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/dataset-onboarding-graph-preprocess/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>dataset-overview-analysis</name>\n      <description>对已经形成标准图结构的电话网络数据集做总体概览，统计号码规模、通话边规模、设备边规模、风险标签分布、省份分布、时间覆盖和可分析能力范围。适用于回答“数据里有什么、规模多大、能做什么”；不用于建图、TopN 排名、单号码下钻或团伙簇识别。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/dataset-overview-analysis/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>dataset-quality-and-linkability-diagnostic</name>\n      <description>诊断电话网络数据集是否具备标准图结构、数据质量是否满足后续分析条件、各下游 skill 是否可用，并检查多省份数据的 ID 命名空间与跨省可联动性前提。适用于数据体检、能力矩阵、unified 是否支持跨省实体联动等问题；诊断结论不得被夸大为业务事实。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/dataset-quality-and-linkability-diagnostic/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>gang-cluster-analysis</name>\n      <description>围绕一组电话号码或候选对象识别疑似团伙簇，综合共享设备、共同对端、内部关系、邻居重叠和多跳关联输出候选簇、核心节点、桥接点和证据链。适用于团伙/簇/核心成员/桥接点问题；不用于单号码画像、TopN 排名、地域对比或确认性案件定性。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/gang-cluster-analysis/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>graph-operator</name>\n      <description>提供电话网络图数据的基础图分析算子，包括节点查询、邻居展开、共享设备、共同对端、共同设备、路径追踪、子图抽取和基础图统计。该 skill 更适合作为上层业务 skill 的底层积木；普通用户问业务结论时应优先路由到对应业务分析 skill。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/graph-operator/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>group-risk-analysis</name>\n      <description>对一组电话号码开展群体级风险分析，统计群体规模、行为模式、夜间异常、联系人广度、共享设备、共同对端、核心成员和证据完整度。适用于群体画像和群体风险归纳；若用户强调团伙簇、核心节点和桥接点，应优先使用 gang-cluster-analysis。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/group-risk-analysis/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>overlap-analysis</name>\n      <description>分析两个电话号码之间的关系重叠情况，包括共同对端、共享设备、直接通话、重叠比例和关键证据点。适用于用户询问两个号码有没有共同联系人、共同设备或联系圈重叠；不负责多跳路径解释、单号画像、群体分析或地域对比。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/overlap-analysis/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>risk-evidence-pack</name>\n      <description>为单个电话号码生成结构化风险证据包，汇总号码画像、风险结论、通话证据、共享设备证据、共同对端证据、证据评分和后续下钻建议。适用于“为什么高风险”“整理证据包”“生成可交付材料”等问题；不用于全局 TopN 发现或群体团伙识别。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/risk-evidence-pack/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>shared-device-analysis</name>\n      <description>分析电话号码与设备之间的共享关系，支持单号码共享设备扩散、两个号码是否共用设备、单设备挂载号码和设备池线索分析。适用于共享设备/同设备池问题；输出仅作为风险线索，不等同于最终团伙认定或可靠跨省同实体联动判断。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/shared-device-analysis/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>sichuan-shaanxi-comparison</name>\n      <description>比较四川与陕西电话网络数据在对象规模、风险标签、行为模式、共享设备规模、群体结构、时间覆盖和代表性对象上的地域差异。该 skill 只做地域对比和汇报材料，不做跨省同实体联动、跨省共享设备识别或跨省共同对端识别。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/sichuan-shaanxi-comparison/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>single-number-analysis</name>\n      <description>对单个电话号码进行完整综合画像和下钻分析，输出基础属性、通话行为、联系人广度、共享设备、关系圈规模、Top 可疑节点、桥接/枢纽角色、风险解释和 Markdown 报告。适用于完整分析一个号码；若用户要求正式证据包，应使用 risk-evidence-pack。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/single-number-analysis/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>subgraph-extraction-analysis</name>\n      <description>围绕单个中心电话号码抽取 1 跳或 2 跳局部关系子图，输出局部节点、边、邻居结构、局部核心节点和桥接点。仅适用于“抽局部图、看邻居结构、看局部关系圈”的问题；完整单号码综合分析应使用 single-number-analysis。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/subgraph-extraction-analysis/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>time-series-anomaly-analysis</name>\n      <description>围绕单个号码或号码集合的时间变化分析活跃趋势、近期窗口与基线窗口差异、夜间行为变化、异常日期、小时分布和阶段性风险上升。适用于时间趋势和异常突变问题；需要通话边中存在可用时间字段。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/time-series-anomaly-analysis/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>topn-high-risk-discovery</name>\n      <description>在用户没有指定硬性筛选条件时，基于预设综合风险评分模型对电话网络全量号码进行自动打分、排序和候选发现，输出 TopN 高风险排行榜、风险分、排名驱动因素和证据摘要。核心任务是自动发现“最值得优先核查”的对象，不是按用户规则过滤；适用于“找 Top10 高风险号码/生成风险排行榜/哪些号码最可疑/自动发现重点对象/综合评分排序”等开放式发现问题。不用于按省份、标签、夜间阈值、联系人阈值、共享设备阈值等明确条件筛选号码，不解释单个号码，不生成单号码证据包，不做原始数据建图或地域对比。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/topn-high-risk-discovery/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n</available_skills>\n\n</skill_system>","additional_kwargs":{"message_type":"routed_skill_prompt","internal":true},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":"routing_skill_guidance","id":"a30b8aab-bde7-4265-a318-eb7e82eb856d"}],"viewed_images":{},"thread_data":{"workspace_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/15cecaf4-732f-4d0b-9004-3f1404db7747/user-data/workspace","uploads_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/15cecaf4-732f-4d0b-9004-3f1404db7747/user-data/uploads","outputs_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/15cecaf4-732f-4d0b-9004-3f1404db7747/user-data/outputs"},"raw_messages":[{"content":"请把仓库事件的截图、前后 20 秒片段、哈希和打码副本整理成证据包。","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":null,"id":"22168275-7548-47d3-b77f-f0605db52d74"},{"content":"<skill_system source=\"skill_router\">\nYou have access to skills that provide optimized workflows for specific tasks. Each skill contains best practices, frameworks, and references to additional resources.\n\n**Skill Availability Rules:**\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt are available across turns.\n- Custom/domain skills are available only when listed in a current-turn routed <available_skills> section.\n- Ignore custom/domain skills mentioned in previous turns if they are not listed in the current turn.\n- Do not call tools associated with unavailable skills.\n- If a later current-turn routed_skill_prompt is injected by SkillRouter, its <available_skills> list recommends the custom/domain skills for this turn; public skills from the base prompt remain available as supporting workflows.\n- When SkillRouter ranking is disabled and scene filtering injects all skills for a scene, treat <available_skills> as an allowed candidate set. Select the specific skill or skills that match the current user request before loading skill files or executing workflows.\n\n**Override Scope:**\n- This routed <skill_system> lists recommended custom/domain skills for the current turn.\n- It does NOT replace the base system prompt.\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt remain available for supporting operations.\n- When uploaded structured files (Excel, CSV, JSON, Parquet, or similar tabular evidence) are central to the user's request, use the public data-analysis skill first to inspect and extract facts before domain synthesis.\n- Continue following language_policy, clarification_system, working_directory, response_style, and critical_reminders from the base system prompt.\n\n**Progressive Loading Pattern:**\n1. When a user query matches an available skill's use case, first choose the concrete skill.\n2. Call `invoke_skill` in `prepare` mode for that selected skill to create and validate the SkillInputEnvelope and legacy invocation package.\n3. Read the returned skill file path and understand the skill's workflow and instructions.\n4. The skill file contains references to external resources under the same folder.\n5. Load referenced resources only when needed during execution.\n6. Follow the skill's instructions precisely.\n7. After legacy execution, call `invoke_skill` in `wrap_output` mode to normalize the result into SkillResult when a machine-readable Skill output is needed.\n\n**Mandatory Skill Execution Discipline:**\n- Calling `invoke_skill` in `prepare` mode is NOT sufficient. It only prepares the selected Skill invocation. After `prepare`, you MUST actually execute the selected Skill workflow.\n- After `invoke_skill(mode=\"prepare\")` returns `legacy_invocation.container_skill_file`, you MUST read that Skill file and treat it as the authoritative execution guide.\n- If the Skill provides scripts, commands, templates, references, or executable workflows, you MUST use those Skill-provided assets first.\n- Do NOT replace a matched Skill workflow with ad hoc Python, pandas, SQL, shell, or manual analysis code before attempting the Skill workflow.\n- For `data-analysis`, if `/mnt/skills/public/data-analysis/scripts/analyze.py` is available and the task is structured data analysis, you MUST call that script first for data inspection, SQL query, aggregation, statistics, or chart preparation. Do not write standalone pandas code for the same operation before trying this script.\n- Custom code is allowed only after one of these conditions is true:\n  1. the selected Skill file does not provide a suitable executable workflow;\n  2. the Skill-provided script or workflow has been attempted and failed;\n  3. the user explicitly requests custom code;\n  4. the required operation is clearly outside the Skill's documented capability.\n- When you fall back to custom code, briefly state that the Skill workflow was insufficient or failed, and continue from the Skill result or error.\n\n**Skill Loading Priority Rules:**\n- If a request clearly matches an available skill and also includes uploaded files, load the skill file before reading uploaded data files.\n- Do NOT read a full uploaded structured data file before loading the matched skill.\n- For uploaded structured data files, use small previews only when needed.\n- Prefer the matched skill's scripts, workflows, or tools for actual analysis.\n- Do not start by generating ad hoc JS, Python, SQL, or shell scripts when a matched skill exists.\n- Only improvise custom code after loading the matched skill and confirming the skill does not already provide a suitable workflow.\n\n**Skills are located at:** /mnt/skills\n\n<available_skills>\n    <skill>\n      <name>association-path-analysis</name>\n      <description>分析两个电话号码之间是否存在直接通话路径、间接多跳路径、共享设备路径、共同对端路径或复合桥接链路。适用于用户询问两个号码如何关联、是否存在中间节点或关系链路的场景；不用于数据概览、TopN 风险发现、单号码画像、群体团伙识别或跨省同实体联动判断。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/association-path-analysis/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>condition-based-screening</name>\n      <description>根据用户已经明确给出的筛选条件，在电话网络号码集合中执行规则过滤，找出“满足这些条件”的对象，并输出筛选链路、命中号码、命中原因和证据附件。核心任务是条件命中，不是风险排行榜；适用于用户明确提出“筛选/过滤/满足条件/按省份/按标签/按阈值/同时满足”等规则约束的场景，例如筛选夜间通话占比超过阈值、联系人广度高于阈值、共享设备数量达到阈值的号码。不用于系统自动发现最可疑号码、不生成全量 TopN 风险榜、不做综合风险排名、不承担单号码证据包、原始数据建图或地域对比。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/condition-based-screening/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>dataset-onboarding-graph-preprocess</name>\n      <description>将新上传的电话网络原始 CSV、Excel、JSON 或 Parquet 数据进行字段识别、清洗、质量检查和建图预处理，生成 user_nodes.csv、call_edges.csv、edges_phone_imei.parquet 等标准图结构文件。适用于原始数据接入、无法建图诊断和字段映射；已是标准图结构的数据应先走数据质量诊断或具体分析 skill。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/dataset-onboarding-graph-preprocess/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>dataset-overview-analysis</name>\n      <description>对已经形成标准图结构的电话网络数据集做总体概览，统计号码规模、通话边规模、设备边规模、风险标签分布、省份分布、时间覆盖和可分析能力范围。适用于回答“数据里有什么、规模多大、能做什么”；不用于建图、TopN 排名、单号码下钻或团伙簇识别。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/dataset-overview-analysis/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>dataset-quality-and-linkability-diagnostic</name>\n      <description>诊断电话网络数据集是否具备标准图结构、数据质量是否满足后续分析条件、各下游 skill 是否可用，并检查多省份数据的 ID 命名空间与跨省可联动性前提。适用于数据体检、能力矩阵、unified 是否支持跨省实体联动等问题；诊断结论不得被夸大为业务事实。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/dataset-quality-and-linkability-diagnostic/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>gang-cluster-analysis</name>\n      <description>围绕一组电话号码或候选对象识别疑似团伙簇，综合共享设备、共同对端、内部关系、邻居重叠和多跳关联输出候选簇、核心节点、桥接点和证据链。适用于团伙/簇/核心成员/桥接点问题；不用于单号码画像、TopN 排名、地域对比或确认性案件定性。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/gang-cluster-analysis/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>graph-operator</name>\n      <description>提供电话网络图数据的基础图分析算子，包括节点查询、邻居展开、共享设备、共同对端、共同设备、路径追踪、子图抽取和基础图统计。该 skill 更适合作为上层业务 skill 的底层积木；普通用户问业务结论时应优先路由到对应业务分析 skill。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/graph-operator/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>group-risk-analysis</name>\n      <description>对一组电话号码开展群体级风险分析，统计群体规模、行为模式、夜间异常、联系人广度、共享设备、共同对端、核心成员和证据完整度。适用于群体画像和群体风险归纳；若用户强调团伙簇、核心节点和桥接点，应优先使用 gang-cluster-analysis。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/group-risk-analysis/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>overlap-analysis</name>\n      <description>分析两个电话号码之间的关系重叠情况，包括共同对端、共享设备、直接通话、重叠比例和关键证据点。适用于用户询问两个号码有没有共同联系人、共同设备或联系圈重叠；不负责多跳路径解释、单号画像、群体分析或地域对比。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/overlap-analysis/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>risk-evidence-pack</name>\n      <description>为单个电话号码生成结构化风险证据包，汇总号码画像、风险结论、通话证据、共享设备证据、共同对端证据、证据评分和后续下钻建议。适用于“为什么高风险”“整理证据包”“生成可交付材料”等问题；不用于全局 TopN 发现或群体团伙识别。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/risk-evidence-pack/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>shared-device-analysis</name>\n      <description>分析电话号码与设备之间的共享关系，支持单号码共享设备扩散、两个号码是否共用设备、单设备挂载号码和设备池线索分析。适用于共享设备/同设备池问题；输出仅作为风险线索，不等同于最终团伙认定或可靠跨省同实体联动判断。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/shared-device-analysis/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>sichuan-shaanxi-comparison</name>\n      <description>比较四川与陕西电话网络数据在对象规模、风险标签、行为模式、共享设备规模、群体结构、时间覆盖和代表性对象上的地域差异。该 skill 只做地域对比和汇报材料，不做跨省同实体联动、跨省共享设备识别或跨省共同对端识别。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/sichuan-shaanxi-comparison/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>single-number-analysis</name>\n      <description>对单个电话号码进行完整综合画像和下钻分析，输出基础属性、通话行为、联系人广度、共享设备、关系圈规模、Top 可疑节点、桥接/枢纽角色、风险解释和 Markdown 报告。适用于完整分析一个号码；若用户要求正式证据包，应使用 risk-evidence-pack。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/single-number-analysis/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>subgraph-extraction-analysis</name>\n      <description>围绕单个中心电话号码抽取 1 跳或 2 跳局部关系子图，输出局部节点、边、邻居结构、局部核心节点和桥接点。仅适用于“抽局部图、看邻居结构、看局部关系圈”的问题；完整单号码综合分析应使用 single-number-analysis。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/subgraph-extraction-analysis/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>time-series-anomaly-analysis</name>\n      <description>围绕单个号码或号码集合的时间变化分析活跃趋势、近期窗口与基线窗口差异、夜间行为变化、异常日期、小时分布和阶段性风险上升。适用于时间趋势和异常突变问题；需要通话边中存在可用时间字段。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/time-series-anomaly-analysis/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>topn-high-risk-discovery</name>\n      <description>在用户没有指定硬性筛选条件时，基于预设综合风险评分模型对电话网络全量号码进行自动打分、排序和候选发现，输出 TopN 高风险排行榜、风险分、排名驱动因素和证据摘要。核心任务是自动发现“最值得优先核查”的对象，不是按用户规则过滤；适用于“找 Top10 高风险号码/生成风险排行榜/哪些号码最可疑/自动发现重点对象/综合评分排序”等开放式发现问题。不用于按省份、标签、夜间阈值、联系人阈值、共享设备阈值等明确条件筛选号码，不解释单个号码，不生成单号码证据包，不做原始数据建图或地域对比。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/topn-high-risk-discovery/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n</available_skills>\n\n</skill_system>","additional_kwargs":{"message_type":"routed_skill_prompt","internal":true},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":"routing_skill_guidance","id":"a30b8aab-bde7-4265-a318-eb7e82eb856d"}],"artifacts":[],"intent_context":{"intent":"task","original_query":"请把仓库事件的截图、前后 20 秒片段、哈希和打码副本整理成证据包。","normalized_query":"请把仓库事件的截图、前后 20 秒片段、哈希和打码副本整理成证据包。","routing_query":"场景：电话网络。场景ID：phone_network。场景说明：电话通信网络、移动通信网络、基站、小区、话单、CDR、通话记录、呼叫链路、信令、IMS、VoLTE、短信、漫游、掉话、接通率、投诉、通信质量、号码画像、共享设备、共同对端、关联路径、团伙聚类、风险证据包和高风险号码分析场景。需要识别参数：分析对象、时间范围、网络指标、分析目标。用户原始问题：我将把仓库事件的截图、前后20秒片段、哈希和打码副本整理成证据包","scene":"phone_network","scene_name":"电话网络","params":{"分析对象":"","时间范围":"","网络指标":"","分析目标":""},"scene_mode":"single","scenes":["phone_network"],"task_spans":[{"task_span_id":"span_b3515f","text":"请把仓库事件的截图、前后 20 秒片段、哈希和打码副本整理成证据包。"}],"planning_steps":[{"task_span_id":"span_9501ab","text":"读取仓库事件相关的截图、前后20秒视频片段、哈希值文件及打码副本，解析视频时间轴与帧结构，执行文件完整性校验与哈希一致性比对，输出结构化媒体索引表及合格文件集。"},{"task_span_id":"span_cefc15","text":"结合phone_network场景需求，提取媒体文件中的事件时间戳，检索并对齐对应的通信链路或基站信令时序数据，建立多模态证据与网络参数的时间映射关系，输出场景关联标注清单。"},{"task_span_id":"span_d253a7","text":"依据电子取证规范对校验通过的媒体文件、网络映射数据进行分类归档，生成打码副本的数字指纹与防篡改签名，配置压缩包访问权限，输出符合司法或审计标准的初步证据包。"},{"task_span_id":"span_ede8f5","text":"汇总文件清单、哈希校验报告、场景分析依据与操作溯源记录，打包生成最终交付物，提供可回溯的证据链说明文档供后续研判调用。"}],"scene_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_4fe76d","scene":"phone_network","scene_name":"电话网络","text":"我将把仓库事件的截图、前后20秒片段、哈希和打码副本整理成证据包。","params":{}}],"sub_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_4fe76d","scene":"phone_network","scene_name":"电话网络","text":"我将把仓库事件的截图、前后20秒片段、哈希和打码副本整理成证据包。","params":{}}],"task_hints":["提取必填参数：分析对象。需要分析的电话网络数据、话单 CDR、基站、小区、用户号码、呼叫链路、短信记录、信令日志或通信事件","提取可选参数：时间范围。电话网络统计或故障分析的起止时间、日期、时段或相对时间","提取可选参数：网络指标。电话网络指标，如接通率、掉话率、呼叫失败、通话时长、短信量、漫游、信令异常、IMS、VoLTE、基站负荷、小区拥塞等","提取可选参数：分析目标。统计、对比、定位故障、识别异常、投诉研判、质量评估、趋势分析或生成报告"],"mentioned_skill_ids":[],"confidence":0.9,"reason":"llm_scene_slot_rewrite","_source_message_key":"id:22168275-7548-47d3-b77f-f0605db52d74"},"routing_context":{"route_mode":"scene_filter","trigger":true,"primary_goal":"请把仓库事件的截图、前后 20 秒片段、哈希和打码副本整理成证据包。","scene_tasks":[{"scene_task_id":"task_001","segment_id":"seg_001","segment_text":"请把仓库事件的截图、前后 20 秒片段、哈希和打码副本整理成证据包。","scene":"phone_network","input_refs":[],"task_types":[],"selected_skills":[{"id":"association-path-analysis","role":"primary","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"condition-based-screening","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"dataset-onboarding-graph-preprocess","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"dataset-overview-analysis","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"dataset-quality-and-linkability-diagnostic","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"gang-cluster-analysis","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"graph-operator","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"group-risk-analysis","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"overlap-analysis","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"risk-evidence-pack","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"shared-device-analysis","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"sichuan-shaanxi-comparison","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"single-number-analysis","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"subgraph-extraction-analysis","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"time-series-anomaly-analysis","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"topn-high-risk-discovery","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null}],"expected_outputs":[],"depends_on":[]}],"global_selected_skills":["association-path-analysis","condition-based-screening","dataset-onboarding-graph-preprocess","dataset-overview-analysis","dataset-quality-and-linkability-diagnostic","gang-cluster-analysis","graph-operator","group-risk-analysis","overlap-analysis","risk-evidence-pack","shared-device-analysis","sichuan-shaanxi-comparison","single-number-analysis","subgraph-extraction-analysis","time-series-anomaly-analysis","topn-high-risk-discovery"],"default_public_skill_ids":[],"global_allowed_tools":[],"confidence":1.0,"route_reason":"SkillRouter disabled; injected all custom skills for detected intent scene as LeadAgent candidate skills","allowed_skills":["association-path-analysis","condition-based-screening","dataset-onboarding-graph-preprocess","dataset-overview-analysis","dataset-quality-and-linkability-diagnostic","gang-cluster-analysis","graph-operator","group-risk-analysis","overlap-analysis","risk-evidence-pack","shared-device-analysis","sichuan-shaanxi-comparison","single-number-analysis","subgraph-extraction-analysis","time-series-anomaly-analysis","topn-high-risk-discovery"],"selection_owner":"lead_agent","_source_message_key":"id:22168275-7548-47d3-b77f-f0605db52d74"},"dialogue_context":{"act":"new_task","confidence":0.7,"reason":"no_pending_action_match","parsed_answer":null,"pending_action_id":null,"resume_intent_context":null,"resume_routing_context":null,"metadata":{}},"final_scope_skill_ids":["association-path-analysis","condition-based-screening","dataset-onboarding-graph-preprocess","dataset-overview-analysis","dataset-quality-and-linkability-diagnostic","gang-cluster-analysis","graph-operator","group-risk-analysis","overlap-analysis","risk-evidence-pack","shared-device-analysis","sichuan-shaanxi-comparison","single-number-analysis","subgraph-extraction-analysis","time-series-anomaly-analysis","topn-high-risk-discovery"],"allowed_tool_names":[]}

event: values
data: {"messages":[{"content":"请把仓库事件的截图、前后 20 秒片段、哈希和打码副本整理成证据包。","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":null,"id":"22168275-7548-47d3-b77f-f0605db52d74"},{"content":"<skill_system source=\"skill_router\">\nYou have access to skills that provide optimized workflows for specific tasks. Each skill contains best practices, frameworks, and references to additional resources.\n\n**Skill Availability Rules:**\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt are available across turns.\n- Custom/domain skills are available only when listed in a current-turn routed <available_skills> section.\n- Ignore custom/domain skills mentioned in previous turns if they are not listed in the current turn.\n- Do not call tools associated with unavailable skills.\n- If a later current-turn routed_skill_prompt is injected by SkillRouter, its <available_skills> list recommends the custom/domain skills for this turn; public skills from the base prompt remain available as supporting workflows.\n- When SkillRouter ranking is disabled and scene filtering injects all skills for a scene, treat <available_skills> as an allowed candidate set. Select the specific skill or skills that match the current user request before loading skill files or executing workflows.\n\n**Override Scope:**\n- This routed <skill_system> lists recommended custom/domain skills for the current turn.\n- It does NOT replace the base system prompt.\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt remain available for supporting operations.\n- When uploaded structured files (Excel, CSV, JSON, Parquet, or similar tabular evidence) are central to the user's request, use the public data-analysis skill first to inspect and extract facts before domain synthesis.\n- Continue following language_policy, clarification_system, working_directory, response_style, and critical_reminders from the base system prompt.\n\n**Progressive Loading Pattern:**\n1. When a user query matches an available skill's use case, first choose the concrete skill.\n2. Call `invoke_skill` in `prepare` mode for that selected skill to create and validate the SkillInputEnvelope and legacy invocation package.\n3. Read the returned skill file path and understand the skill's workflow and instructions.\n4. The skill file contains references to external resources under the same folder.\n5. Load referenced resources only when needed during execution.\n6. Follow the skill's instructions precisely.\n7. After legacy execution, call `invoke_skill` in `wrap_output` mode to normalize the result into SkillResult when a machine-readable Skill output is needed.\n\n**Mandatory Skill Execution Discipline:**\n- Calling `invoke_skill` in `prepare` mode is NOT sufficient. It only prepares the selected Skill invocation. After `prepare`, you MUST actually execute the selected Skill workflow.\n- After `invoke_skill(mode=\"prepare\")` returns `legacy_invocation.container_skill_file`, you MUST read that Skill file and treat it as the authoritative execution guide.\n- If the Skill provides scripts, commands, templates, references, or executable workflows, you MUST use those Skill-provided assets first.\n- Do NOT replace a matched Skill workflow with ad hoc Python, pandas, SQL, shell, or manual analysis code before attempting the Skill workflow.\n- For `data-analysis`, if `/mnt/skills/public/data-analysis/scripts/analyze.py` is available and the task is structured data analysis, you MUST call that script first for data inspection, SQL query, aggregation, statistics, or chart preparation. Do not write standalone pandas code for the same operation before trying this script.\n- Custom code is allowed only after one of these conditions is true:\n  1. the selected Skill file does not provide a suitable executable workflow;\n  2. the Skill-provided script or workflow has been attempted and failed;\n  3. the user explicitly requests custom code;\n  4. the required operation is clearly outside the Skill's documented capability.\n- When you fall back to custom code, briefly state that the Skill workflow was insufficient or failed, and continue from the Skill result or error.\n\n**Skill Loading Priority Rules:**\n- If a request clearly matches an available skill and also includes uploaded files, load the skill file before reading uploaded data files.\n- Do NOT read a full uploaded structured data file before loading the matched skill.\n- For uploaded structured data files, use small previews only when needed.\n- Prefer the matched skill's scripts, workflows, or tools for actual analysis.\n- Do not start by generating ad hoc JS, Python, SQL, or shell scripts when a matched skill exists.\n- Only improvise custom code after loading the matched skill and confirming the skill does not already provide a suitable workflow.\n\n**Skills are located at:** /mnt/skills\n\n<available_skills>\n    <skill>\n      <name>association-path-analysis</name>\n      <description>分析两个电话号码之间是否存在直接通话路径、间接多跳路径、共享设备路径、共同对端路径或复合桥接链路。适用于用户询问两个号码如何关联、是否存在中间节点或关系链路的场景；不用于数据概览、TopN 风险发现、单号码画像、群体团伙识别或跨省同实体联动判断。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/association-path-analysis/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>condition-based-screening</name>\n      <description>根据用户已经明确给出的筛选条件，在电话网络号码集合中执行规则过滤，找出“满足这些条件”的对象，并输出筛选链路、命中号码、命中原因和证据附件。核心任务是条件命中，不是风险排行榜；适用于用户明确提出“筛选/过滤/满足条件/按省份/按标签/按阈值/同时满足”等规则约束的场景，例如筛选夜间通话占比超过阈值、联系人广度高于阈值、共享设备数量达到阈值的号码。不用于系统自动发现最可疑号码、不生成全量 TopN 风险榜、不做综合风险排名、不承担单号码证据包、原始数据建图或地域对比。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/condition-based-screening/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>dataset-onboarding-graph-preprocess</name>\n      <description>将新上传的电话网络原始 CSV、Excel、JSON 或 Parquet 数据进行字段识别、清洗、质量检查和建图预处理，生成 user_nodes.csv、call_edges.csv、edges_phone_imei.parquet 等标准图结构文件。适用于原始数据接入、无法建图诊断和字段映射；已是标准图结构的数据应先走数据质量诊断或具体分析 skill。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/dataset-onboarding-graph-preprocess/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>dataset-overview-analysis</name>\n      <description>对已经形成标准图结构的电话网络数据集做总体概览，统计号码规模、通话边规模、设备边规模、风险标签分布、省份分布、时间覆盖和可分析能力范围。适用于回答“数据里有什么、规模多大、能做什么”；不用于建图、TopN 排名、单号码下钻或团伙簇识别。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/dataset-overview-analysis/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>dataset-quality-and-linkability-diagnostic</name>\n      <description>诊断电话网络数据集是否具备标准图结构、数据质量是否满足后续分析条件、各下游 skill 是否可用，并检查多省份数据的 ID 命名空间与跨省可联动性前提。适用于数据体检、能力矩阵、unified 是否支持跨省实体联动等问题；诊断结论不得被夸大为业务事实。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/dataset-quality-and-linkability-diagnostic/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>gang-cluster-analysis</name>\n      <description>围绕一组电话号码或候选对象识别疑似团伙簇，综合共享设备、共同对端、内部关系、邻居重叠和多跳关联输出候选簇、核心节点、桥接点和证据链。适用于团伙/簇/核心成员/桥接点问题；不用于单号码画像、TopN 排名、地域对比或确认性案件定性。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/gang-cluster-analysis/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>graph-operator</name>\n      <description>提供电话网络图数据的基础图分析算子，包括节点查询、邻居展开、共享设备、共同对端、共同设备、路径追踪、子图抽取和基础图统计。该 skill 更适合作为上层业务 skill 的底层积木；普通用户问业务结论时应优先路由到对应业务分析 skill。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/graph-operator/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>group-risk-analysis</name>\n      <description>对一组电话号码开展群体级风险分析，统计群体规模、行为模式、夜间异常、联系人广度、共享设备、共同对端、核心成员和证据完整度。适用于群体画像和群体风险归纳；若用户强调团伙簇、核心节点和桥接点，应优先使用 gang-cluster-analysis。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/group-risk-analysis/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>overlap-analysis</name>\n      <description>分析两个电话号码之间的关系重叠情况，包括共同对端、共享设备、直接通话、重叠比例和关键证据点。适用于用户询问两个号码有没有共同联系人、共同设备或联系圈重叠；不负责多跳路径解释、单号画像、群体分析或地域对比。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/overlap-analysis/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>risk-evidence-pack</name>\n      <description>为单个电话号码生成结构化风险证据包，汇总号码画像、风险结论、通话证据、共享设备证据、共同对端证据、证据评分和后续下钻建议。适用于“为什么高风险”“整理证据包”“生成可交付材料”等问题；不用于全局 TopN 发现或群体团伙识别。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/risk-evidence-pack/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>shared-device-analysis</name>\n      <description>分析电话号码与设备之间的共享关系，支持单号码共享设备扩散、两个号码是否共用设备、单设备挂载号码和设备池线索分析。适用于共享设备/同设备池问题；输出仅作为风险线索，不等同于最终团伙认定或可靠跨省同实体联动判断。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/shared-device-analysis/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>sichuan-shaanxi-comparison</name>\n      <description>比较四川与陕西电话网络数据在对象规模、风险标签、行为模式、共享设备规模、群体结构、时间覆盖和代表性对象上的地域差异。该 skill 只做地域对比和汇报材料，不做跨省同实体联动、跨省共享设备识别或跨省共同对端识别。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/sichuan-shaanxi-comparison/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>single-number-analysis</name>\n      <description>对单个电话号码进行完整综合画像和下钻分析，输出基础属性、通话行为、联系人广度、共享设备、关系圈规模、Top 可疑节点、桥接/枢纽角色、风险解释和 Markdown 报告。适用于完整分析一个号码；若用户要求正式证据包，应使用 risk-evidence-pack。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/single-number-analysis/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>subgraph-extraction-analysis</name>\n      <description>围绕单个中心电话号码抽取 1 跳或 2 跳局部关系子图，输出局部节点、边、邻居结构、局部核心节点和桥接点。仅适用于“抽局部图、看邻居结构、看局部关系圈”的问题；完整单号码综合分析应使用 single-number-analysis。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/subgraph-extraction-analysis/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>time-series-anomaly-analysis</name>\n      <description>围绕单个号码或号码集合的时间变化分析活跃趋势、近期窗口与基线窗口差异、夜间行为变化、异常日期、小时分布和阶段性风险上升。适用于时间趋势和异常突变问题；需要通话边中存在可用时间字段。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/time-series-anomaly-analysis/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>topn-high-risk-discovery</name>\n      <description>在用户没有指定硬性筛选条件时，基于预设综合风险评分模型对电话网络全量号码进行自动打分、排序和候选发现，输出 TopN 高风险排行榜、风险分、排名驱动因素和证据摘要。核心任务是自动发现“最值得优先核查”的对象，不是按用户规则过滤；适用于“找 Top10 高风险号码/生成风险排行榜/哪些号码最可疑/自动发现重点对象/综合评分排序”等开放式发现问题。不用于按省份、标签、夜间阈值、联系人阈值、共享设备阈值等明确条件筛选号码，不解释单个号码，不生成单号码证据包，不做原始数据建图或地域对比。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/topn-high-risk-discovery/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n</available_skills>\n\n</skill_system>","additional_kwargs":{"message_type":"routed_skill_prompt","internal":true},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":"routing_skill_guidance","id":"a30b8aab-bde7-4265-a318-eb7e82eb856d"},{"content":"<system_reminder>\nUse the following current-turn intent and routing guidance when deciding whether to create or update todos. Treat it as planning context, not as a user request.\n<hidden_step source=\"intent_recognition\" title=\"意图识别\">\n改写后的任务：场景：电话网络。场景ID：phone_network\n识别场景：电话网络 (phone_network)；场景模式：single；候选场景：phone_network\n任务切分：\n- 请把仓库事件的截图、前后 20 秒片段、哈希和打码副本整理成证据包。\n任务规划：\n1. 读取仓库事件相关的截图、前后20秒视频片段、哈希值文件及打码副本，解析视频时间轴与帧结构，执行文件完整性校验与哈希一致性比对，输出结构化媒体索引表及合格文件集。\n2. 结合phone_network场景需求，提取媒体文件中的事件时间戳，检索并对齐对应的通信链路或基站信令时序数据，建立多模态证据与网络参数的时间映射关系，输出场景关联标注清单。\n3. 依据电子取证规范对校验通过的媒体文件、网络映射数据进行分类归档，生成打码副本的数字指纹与防篡改签名，配置压缩包访问权限，输出符合司法或审计标准的初步证据包。\n4. 汇总文件清单、哈希校验报告、场景分析依据与操作溯源记录，打包生成最终交付物，提供可回溯的证据链说明文档供后续研判调用。\n场景任务：\n- phone_network: 我将把仓库事件的截图、前后20秒片段、哈希和打码副本整理成证据包。\n已提取参数：{'分析对象': '', '时间范围': '', '网络指标': '', '分析目标': ''}\n任务提示：\n- 提取必填参数：分析对象。需要分析的电话网络数据、话单 CDR、基站、小区、用户号码、呼叫链路、短信记录、信令日志或通信事件\n- 提取可选参数：时间范围。电话网络统计或故障分析的起止时间、日期、时段或相对时间\n- 提取可选参数：网络指标。电话网络指标，如接通率、掉话率、呼叫失败、通话时长、短信量、漫游、信令异常、IMS、VoLTE、基站负荷、小区拥塞等\n- 提取可选参数：分析目标。统计、对比、定位故障、识别异常、投诉研判、质量评估、趋势分析或生成报告\n</hidden_step>\n</system_reminder>","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":"todo_routing_guidance","id":"b2828d99-f08f-4266-bf4e-d5284819d29a"}],"viewed_images":{},"thread_data":{"workspace_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/15cecaf4-732f-4d0b-9004-3f1404db7747/user-data/workspace","uploads_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/15cecaf4-732f-4d0b-9004-3f1404db7747/user-data/uploads","outputs_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/15cecaf4-732f-4d0b-9004-3f1404db7747/user-data/outputs"},"raw_messages":[{"content":"请把仓库事件的截图、前后 20 秒片段、哈希和打码副本整理成证据包。","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":null,"id":"22168275-7548-47d3-b77f-f0605db52d74"},{"content":"<skill_system source=\"skill_router\">\nYou have access to skills that provide optimized workflows for specific tasks. Each skill contains best practices, frameworks, and references to additional resources.\n\n**Skill Availability Rules:**\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt are available across turns.\n- Custom/domain skills are available only when listed in a current-turn routed <available_skills> section.\n- Ignore custom/domain skills mentioned in previous turns if they are not listed in the current turn.\n- Do not call tools associated with unavailable skills.\n- If a later current-turn routed_skill_prompt is injected by SkillRouter, its <available_skills> list recommends the custom/domain skills for this turn; public skills from the base prompt remain available as supporting workflows.\n- When SkillRouter ranking is disabled and scene filtering injects all skills for a scene, treat <available_skills> as an allowed candidate set. Select the specific skill or skills that match the current user request before loading skill files or executing workflows.\n\n**Override Scope:**\n- This routed <skill_system> lists recommended custom/domain skills for the current turn.\n- It does NOT replace the base system prompt.\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt remain available for supporting operations.\n- When uploaded structured files (Excel, CSV, JSON, Parquet, or similar tabular evidence) are central to the user's request, use the public data-analysis skill first to inspect and extract facts before domain synthesis.\n- Continue following language_policy, clarification_system, working_directory, response_style, and critical_reminders from the base system prompt.\n\n**Progressive Loading Pattern:**\n1. When a user query matches an available skill's use case, first choose the concrete skill.\n2. Call `invoke_skill` in `prepare` mode for that selected skill to create and validate the SkillInputEnvelope and legacy invocation package.\n3. Read the returned skill file path and understand the skill's workflow and instructions.\n4. The skill file contains references to external resources under the same folder.\n5. Load referenced resources only when needed during execution.\n6. Follow the skill's instructions precisely.\n7. After legacy execution, call `invoke_skill` in `wrap_output` mode to normalize the result into SkillResult when a machine-readable Skill output is needed.\n\n**Mandatory Skill Execution Discipline:**\n- Calling `invoke_skill` in `prepare` mode is NOT sufficient. It only prepares the selected Skill invocation. After `prepare`, you MUST actually execute the selected Skill workflow.\n- After `invoke_skill(mode=\"prepare\")` returns `legacy_invocation.container_skill_file`, you MUST read that Skill file and treat it as the authoritative execution guide.\n- If the Skill provides scripts, commands, templates, references, or executable workflows, you MUST use those Skill-provided assets first.\n- Do NOT replace a matched Skill workflow with ad hoc Python, pandas, SQL, shell, or manual analysis code before attempting the Skill workflow.\n- For `data-analysis`, if `/mnt/skills/public/data-analysis/scripts/analyze.py` is available and the task is structured data analysis, you MUST call that script first for data inspection, SQL query, aggregation, statistics, or chart preparation. Do not write standalone pandas code for the same operation before trying this script.\n- Custom code is allowed only after one of these conditions is true:\n  1. the selected Skill file does not provide a suitable executable workflow;\n  2. the Skill-provided script or workflow has been attempted and failed;\n  3. the user explicitly requests custom code;\n  4. the required operation is clearly outside the Skill's documented capability.\n- When you fall back to custom code, briefly state that the Skill workflow was insufficient or failed, and continue from the Skill result or error.\n\n**Skill Loading Priority Rules:**\n- If a request clearly matches an available skill and also includes uploaded files, load the skill file before reading uploaded data files.\n- Do NOT read a full uploaded structured data file before loading the matched skill.\n- For uploaded structured data files, use small previews only when needed.\n- Prefer the matched skill's scripts, workflows, or tools for actual analysis.\n- Do not start by generating ad hoc JS, Python, SQL, or shell scripts when a matched skill exists.\n- Only improvise custom code after loading the matched skill and confirming the skill does not already provide a suitable workflow.\n\n**Skills are located at:** /mnt/skills\n\n<available_skills>\n    <skill>\n      <name>association-path-analysis</name>\n      <description>分析两个电话号码之间是否存在直接通话路径、间接多跳路径、共享设备路径、共同对端路径或复合桥接链路。适用于用户询问两个号码如何关联、是否存在中间节点或关系链路的场景；不用于数据概览、TopN 风险发现、单号码画像、群体团伙识别或跨省同实体联动判断。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/association-path-analysis/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>condition-based-screening</name>\n      <description>根据用户已经明确给出的筛选条件，在电话网络号码集合中执行规则过滤，找出“满足这些条件”的对象，并输出筛选链路、命中号码、命中原因和证据附件。核心任务是条件命中，不是风险排行榜；适用于用户明确提出“筛选/过滤/满足条件/按省份/按标签/按阈值/同时满足”等规则约束的场景，例如筛选夜间通话占比超过阈值、联系人广度高于阈值、共享设备数量达到阈值的号码。不用于系统自动发现最可疑号码、不生成全量 TopN 风险榜、不做综合风险排名、不承担单号码证据包、原始数据建图或地域对比。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/condition-based-screening/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>dataset-onboarding-graph-preprocess</name>\n      <description>将新上传的电话网络原始 CSV、Excel、JSON 或 Parquet 数据进行字段识别、清洗、质量检查和建图预处理，生成 user_nodes.csv、call_edges.csv、edges_phone_imei.parquet 等标准图结构文件。适用于原始数据接入、无法建图诊断和字段映射；已是标准图结构的数据应先走数据质量诊断或具体分析 skill。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/dataset-onboarding-graph-preprocess/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>dataset-overview-analysis</name>\n      <description>对已经形成标准图结构的电话网络数据集做总体概览，统计号码规模、通话边规模、设备边规模、风险标签分布、省份分布、时间覆盖和可分析能力范围。适用于回答“数据里有什么、规模多大、能做什么”；不用于建图、TopN 排名、单号码下钻或团伙簇识别。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/dataset-overview-analysis/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>dataset-quality-and-linkability-diagnostic</name>\n      <description>诊断电话网络数据集是否具备标准图结构、数据质量是否满足后续分析条件、各下游 skill 是否可用，并检查多省份数据的 ID 命名空间与跨省可联动性前提。适用于数据体检、能力矩阵、unified 是否支持跨省实体联动等问题；诊断结论不得被夸大为业务事实。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/dataset-quality-and-linkability-diagnostic/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>gang-cluster-analysis</name>\n      <description>围绕一组电话号码或候选对象识别疑似团伙簇，综合共享设备、共同对端、内部关系、邻居重叠和多跳关联输出候选簇、核心节点、桥接点和证据链。适用于团伙/簇/核心成员/桥接点问题；不用于单号码画像、TopN 排名、地域对比或确认性案件定性。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/gang-cluster-analysis/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>graph-operator</name>\n      <description>提供电话网络图数据的基础图分析算子，包括节点查询、邻居展开、共享设备、共同对端、共同设备、路径追踪、子图抽取和基础图统计。该 skill 更适合作为上层业务 skill 的底层积木；普通用户问业务结论时应优先路由到对应业务分析 skill。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/graph-operator/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>group-risk-analysis</name>\n      <description>对一组电话号码开展群体级风险分析，统计群体规模、行为模式、夜间异常、联系人广度、共享设备、共同对端、核心成员和证据完整度。适用于群体画像和群体风险归纳；若用户强调团伙簇、核心节点和桥接点，应优先使用 gang-cluster-analysis。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/group-risk-analysis/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>overlap-analysis</name>\n      <description>分析两个电话号码之间的关系重叠情况，包括共同对端、共享设备、直接通话、重叠比例和关键证据点。适用于用户询问两个号码有没有共同联系人、共同设备或联系圈重叠；不负责多跳路径解释、单号画像、群体分析或地域对比。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/overlap-analysis/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>risk-evidence-pack</name>\n      <description>为单个电话号码生成结构化风险证据包，汇总号码画像、风险结论、通话证据、共享设备证据、共同对端证据、证据评分和后续下钻建议。适用于“为什么高风险”“整理证据包”“生成可交付材料”等问题；不用于全局 TopN 发现或群体团伙识别。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/risk-evidence-pack/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>shared-device-analysis</name>\n      <description>分析电话号码与设备之间的共享关系，支持单号码共享设备扩散、两个号码是否共用设备、单设备挂载号码和设备池线索分析。适用于共享设备/同设备池问题；输出仅作为风险线索，不等同于最终团伙认定或可靠跨省同实体联动判断。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/shared-device-analysis/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>sichuan-shaanxi-comparison</name>\n      <description>比较四川与陕西电话网络数据在对象规模、风险标签、行为模式、共享设备规模、群体结构、时间覆盖和代表性对象上的地域差异。该 skill 只做地域对比和汇报材料，不做跨省同实体联动、跨省共享设备识别或跨省共同对端识别。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/sichuan-shaanxi-comparison/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>single-number-analysis</name>\n      <description>对单个电话号码进行完整综合画像和下钻分析，输出基础属性、通话行为、联系人广度、共享设备、关系圈规模、Top 可疑节点、桥接/枢纽角色、风险解释和 Markdown 报告。适用于完整分析一个号码；若用户要求正式证据包，应使用 risk-evidence-pack。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/single-number-analysis/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>subgraph-extraction-analysis</name>\n      <description>围绕单个中心电话号码抽取 1 跳或 2 跳局部关系子图，输出局部节点、边、邻居结构、局部核心节点和桥接点。仅适用于“抽局部图、看邻居结构、看局部关系圈”的问题；完整单号码综合分析应使用 single-number-analysis。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/subgraph-extraction-analysis/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>time-series-anomaly-analysis</name>\n      <description>围绕单个号码或号码集合的时间变化分析活跃趋势、近期窗口与基线窗口差异、夜间行为变化、异常日期、小时分布和阶段性风险上升。适用于时间趋势和异常突变问题；需要通话边中存在可用时间字段。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/time-series-anomaly-analysis/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n    <skill>\n      <name>topn-high-risk-discovery</name>\n      <description>在用户没有指定硬性筛选条件时，基于预设综合风险评分模型对电话网络全量号码进行自动打分、排序和候选发现，输出 TopN 高风险排行榜、风险分、排名驱动因素和证据摘要。核心任务是自动发现“最值得优先核查”的对象，不是按用户规则过滤；适用于“找 Top10 高风险号码/生成风险排行榜/哪些号码最可疑/自动发现重点对象/综合评分排序”等开放式发现问题。不用于按省份、标签、夜间阈值、联系人阈值、共享设备阈值等明确条件筛选号码，不解释单个号码，不生成单号码证据包，不做原始数据建图或地域对比。</description>\n      <location>/mnt/skills/custom/phone-network-analysis/topn-high-risk-discovery/SKILL.md</location>\n    </skill>\n</available_skills>\n\n</skill_system>","additional_kwargs":{"message_type":"routed_skill_prompt","internal":true},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":"routing_skill_guidance","id":"a30b8aab-bde7-4265-a318-eb7e82eb856d"}],"artifacts":[],"intent_context":{"intent":"task","original_query":"请把仓库事件的截图、前后 20 秒片段、哈希和打码副本整理成证据包。","normalized_query":"请把仓库事件的截图、前后 20 秒片段、哈希和打码副本整理成证据包。","routing_query":"场景：电话网络。场景ID：phone_network。场景说明：电话通信网络、移动通信网络、基站、小区、话单、CDR、通话记录、呼叫链路、信令、IMS、VoLTE、短信、漫游、掉话、接通率、投诉、通信质量、号码画像、共享设备、共同对端、关联路径、团伙聚类、风险证据包和高风险号码分析场景。需要识别参数：分析对象、时间范围、网络指标、分析目标。用户原始问题：我将把仓库事件的截图、前后20秒片段、哈希和打码副本整理成证据包","scene":"phone_network","scene_name":"电话网络","params":{"分析对象":"","时间范围":"","网络指标":"","分析目标":""},"scene_mode":"single","scenes":["phone_network"],"task_spans":[{"task_span_id":"span_b3515f","text":"请把仓库事件的截图、前后 20 秒片段、哈希和打码副本整理成证据包。"}],"planning_steps":[{"task_span_id":"span_9501ab","text":"读取仓库事件相关的截图、前后20秒视频片段、哈希值文件及打码副本，解析视频时间轴与帧结构，执行文件完整性校验与哈希一致性比对，输出结构化媒体索引表及合格文件集。"},{"task_span_id":"span_cefc15","text":"结合phone_network场景需求，提取媒体文件中的事件时间戳，检索并对齐对应的通信链路或基站信令时序数据，建立多模态证据与网络参数的时间映射关系，输出场景关联标注清单。"},{"task_span_id":"span_d253a7","text":"依据电子取证规范对校验通过的媒体文件、网络映射数据进行分类归档，生成打码副本的数字指纹与防篡改签名，配置压缩包访问权限，输出符合司法或审计标准的初步证据包。"},{"task_span_id":"span_ede8f5","text":"汇总文件清单、哈希校验报告、场景分析依据与操作溯源记录，打包生成最终交付物，提供可回溯的证据链说明文档供后续研判调用。"}],"scene_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_4fe76d","scene":"phone_network","scene_name":"电话网络","text":"我将把仓库事件的截图、前后20秒片段、哈希和打码副本整理成证据包。","params":{}}],"sub_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_4fe76d","scene":"phone_network","scene_name":"电话网络","text":"我将把仓库事件的截图、前后20秒片段、哈希和打码副本整理成证据包。","params":{}}],"task_hints":["提取必填参数：分析对象。需要分析的电话网络数据、话单 CDR、基站、小区、用户号码、呼叫链路、短信记录、信令日志或通信事件","提取可选参数：时间范围。电话网络统计或故障分析的起止时间、日期、时段或相对时间","提取可选参数：网络指标。电话网络指标，如接通率、掉话率、呼叫失败、通话时长、短信量、漫游、信令异常、IMS、VoLTE、基站负荷、小区拥塞等","提取可选参数：分析目标。统计、对比、定位故障、识别异常、投诉研判、质量评估、趋势分析或生成报告"],"mentioned_skill_ids":[],"confidence":0.9,"reason":"llm_scene_slot_rewrite","_source_message_key":"id:22168275-7548-47d3-b77f-f0605db52d74"},"routing_context":{"route_mode":"scene_filter","trigger":true,"primary_goal":"请把仓库事件的截图、前后 20 秒片段、哈希和打码副本整理成证据包。","scene_tasks":[{"scene_task_id":"task_001","segment_id":"seg_001","segment_text":"请把仓库事件的截图、前后 20 秒片段、哈希和打码副本整理成证据包。","scene":"phone_network","input_refs":[],"task_types":[],"selected_skills":[{"id":"association-path-analysis","role":"primary","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"condition-based-screening","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"dataset-onboarding-graph-preprocess","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"dataset-overview-analysis","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"dataset-quality-and-linkability-diagnostic","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"gang-cluster-analysis","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"graph-operator","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"group-risk-analysis","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"overlap-analysis","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"risk-evidence-pack","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"shared-device-analysis","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"sichuan-shaanxi-comparison","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"single-number-analysis","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"subgraph-extraction-analysis","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"time-series-anomaly-analysis","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"topn-high-risk-discovery","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null}],"expected_outputs":[],"depends_on":[]}],"global_selected_skills":["association-path-analysis","condition-based-screening","dataset-onboarding-graph-preprocess","dataset-overview-analysis","dataset-quality-and-linkability-diagnostic","gang-cluster-analysis","graph-operator","group-risk-analysis","overlap-analysis","risk-evidence-pack","shared-device-analysis","sichuan-shaanxi-comparison","single-number-analysis","subgraph-extraction-analysis","time-series-anomaly-analysis","topn-high-risk-discovery"],"default_public_skill_ids":[],"global_allowed_tools":[],"confidence":1.0,"route_reason":"SkillRouter disabled; injected all custom skills for detected intent scene as LeadAgent candidate skills","allowed_skills":["association-path-analysis","condition-based-screening","dataset-onboarding-graph-preprocess","dataset-overview-analysis","dataset-quality-and-linkability-diagnostic","gang-cluster-analysis","graph-operator","group-risk-analysis","overlap-analysis","risk-evidence-pack","shared-device-analysis","sichuan-shaanxi-comparison","single-number-analysis","subgraph-extraction-analysis","time-series-anomaly-analysis","topn-high-risk-discovery"],"selection_owner":"lead_agent","_source_message_key":"id:22168275-7548-47d3-b77f-f0605db52d74"},"dialogue_context":{"act":"new_task","confidence":0.7,"reason":"no_pending_action_match","parsed_answer":null,"pending_action_id":null,"resume_intent_context":null,"resume_routing_context":null,"metadata":{}},"final_scope_skill_ids":["association-path-analysis","condition-based-screening","dataset-onboarding-graph-preprocess","dataset-overview-analysis","dataset-quality-and-linkability-diagnostic","gang-cluster-analysis","graph-operator","group-risk-analysis","overlap-analysis","risk-evidence-pack","shared-device-analysis","sichuan-shaanxi-comparison","single-number-analysis","subgraph-extraction-analysis","time-series-anomaly-analysis","topn-high-risk-discovery"],"allowed_tool_names":[]}

